  "longBusinessSummary": "YOC AG operates as a provider of technologies and software for the digital advertising market in Germany and internationally. The company's products portfolio includes VIS.X, a advertising technology and operator of a scalable trading platform; VIS.X Supply Side platform combines all sales channels and monetize options in an overall approach; VIS.X ADSERVER provides an option of direct trading; VIS.X SDK enables advertisers to reach target group in the mobile environment in app environments, as well as websites; VIS.X Artificial Intelligence, which combines algorithms and machine learning models for media trading in real time; and VIS.X identity Intelligence for branding advertising. It also provides YOC Mystery Ad, which customized HTML5 ads that ensure user interactions and focus on awareness and recognizability of brands and products; YOC Mystery Scroller, a reactive-scroll technology that enables users to interact with advertising messages; YOC Skin, an advertising placement; YOC Zoom Ad, a video ad format to expose brand message; and YOC Spotlight, an ad format that was developed for the CTV environment and combines large-scale presence. In addition, the company offers YOC Understitial Ad, an overlaid website content and revealed by users scrolling; YOC Branded Takeover, which offers a combination of advertising formats; YOC Sitebar, an advertising format that remains visible when the page is scrolled without disrupting the user's reading flow; and YOC Inline Video Ad for advertising messages that can be delivered in both a display and video placement. Further, it provides YOC Universal display solution and YOC Universal Video solution. YOC AG was incorporated in 2000 and is headquartered in Berlin, Germany.",
